And they would have in terms of fruits, they would eat dates or raisins that would come from At-Taef(اَلطَّائِف)

708
01:04:16,921 --> 01:04:22,105
and sometimes they may get dry fruit coming from Ash-Sham(الشّام), so that was it, very, very simple

709
01:04:23,728 --> 01:04:28,246
and now they are being exposed to these different sophisticated styles of cooking.

710
01:04:29,576 --> 01:04:38,025
So Utbah(عتبه) saw in Azerbaijan a dessert called Khabees(خبيس) it was a sweet dish.

711
01:04:38,641 --> 01:04:45,292
He liked it, and they loved the Khalifah(خليفه) so he said: "I must send this to Khalifah(خليفه) to taste it.

712
01:04:46,054 --> 01:04:50,922
It's very good and we want him also to have some, so he prepared alot of it and he send it on a camel

713
01:04:51,752 --> 01:04:57,050
and they took it to Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) in Madina, so he tasted it and it was very sweet.

714
01:04:58,173 --> 01:05:04,921
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab رضي الله عنه said: Do all of the Muslims in Azerbaijan(آزربائجان) have this?

715
01:05:07,211 --> 01:05:08,127
They Said: No.

716
01:05:09,008 --> 01:05:11,255
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) said: Take it back.

717
01:05:12,445 --> 01:05:15,206
Then he sent a letter to Utbah(عتبة), he told him;

718
01:05:16,902 --> 01:05:21,336
It is not the money of your father or the money of your mother that you're spending

719
01:05:22,060 --> 01:05:25,341
do not eat anything unless the Muslims are eating the same thing.

720
01:05:29,448 --> 01:05:31,323
Why are you having this special privilege?

721
01:05:33,315 --> 01:05:34,878
It's none of your parents money.

722
01:05:35,252 --> 01:05:37,249
I've appointed you governor there

723
01:05:42,939 --> 01:05:52,661
and Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) would refuse to have anyone give themselves preference over somebody else

724
01:05:54,383 --> 01:05:55,510
it was unacceptable to him.

725
01:05:57,818 --> 01:05:59,355
One of the kings of Ghassan(غسان).

726
01:05:59,522 --> 01:06:02,069
 Ghassan(غسان) were Arabs, who lived in Ash-Sham(الشام)

727
01:06:02,529 --> 01:06:07,638
they were living under Roman Rule but now Islam was spreading

728
01:06:08,459 --> 01:06:11,575
and the Arab tribes were embracing it.

729
01:06:12,535 --> 01:06:15,107
So Jabillah Bin Aeyhum(جبله ابن ايحم) embraced Islam

730
01:06:15,484 --> 01:06:19,132
and he sent a letter to Umar(عُمَر) telling him that I have embraced Islam, me and my family.

731
01:06:19,612 --> 01:06:21,930
So, we want to visit you in Madina, he is a king.

732
01:06:22,752 --> 01:06:27,490
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) welcomed him in Madina and he was very happy

733
01:06:27,891 --> 01:06:33,499
and he stayed with him in Madina for some time and he honored him, respected him, and welcomed him

734
01:06:34,241 --> 01:06:39,269
and then Jabillah(جبلَّه) wanted to make a Hajj(حَجْ), so he went to Makkah to make Hajj(حَجْ)

735
01:06:40,614 --> 01:06:51,444
and while he was in Tawaf(طواف) a Bedouin, a layman from Banu Fazara(بنو فزاره), Bedouins in desert

736
01:06:52,563 --> 01:07:01,427
they could be a bit crude in their manners, he stepped over the Izar(ازار) of Jabillah(جبلَّه), so it was untied.

737
01:07:03,216 --> 01:07:07,782
Jabillah(جبلَّه) was very upset, how could this Bedouin do this to me?

738
01:07:08,627 --> 01:07:13,685
He's rude, he has no manners, he punched him in his face and broke his nose.

739
01:07:15,673 --> 01:07:18,299
So, the Fazari(فزاري) man went to Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب).

740
01:07:19,788 --> 01:07:22,368
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) calls Jabillah(جبلَّه), Jabillah(جبلَّه) is a new Muslim

741
01:07:23,500 --> 01:07:24,394
Jabillah(جبلَّه) comes in.

742
01:07:24,584 --> 01:07:26,521
Umar(عُمَر) tells him why did you, do that to him?

743
01:07:29,213 --> 01:07:30,324
Jabillah(جبلَّه) said;

744
01:07:31,504 --> 01:07:35,762
"O Ameer-Ul-Mo’mineen(أميرالمؤمنين)! I was very gentle with him,

745
01:07:37,265 --> 01:07:42,724
if it wasn’t for the fact that this is the house of Allah, I would have plucked out his eyes.

746
01:07:46,046 --> 01:07:49,785
He is a king and this lowly man does that to him

747
01:07:50,408 --> 01:07:54,546
I did him a favor, I was gentle with him all what I did, was just to break his nose.

748
01:07:56,359 --> 01:07:59,073
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) said, so you admit your guilt.

749
01:08:00,838 --> 01:08:08,107
You either settle the account with him or he will have to retaliate.

750
01:08:10,421 --> 01:08:16,859
Jabillah(جبلَّه) said: Ameer-Ul- Mo’mineen(امير المؤمنين), I am a king and he is a layman.

751
01:08:19,228 --> 01:08:22,198
He is trying to remind Umar(عُمَر), maybe Umar(عُمَر) forgot to whom he is talking to,

752
01:08:22,752 --> 01:08:24,785
I am a king! And he is a laymen.

753
01:08:25,468 --> 01:08:29,917
You know, because these are new things to him, these are new concepts, he didn’t comprehend it.

754
01:08:30,757 --> 01:08:34,696
I am a king and he is a layman, what you mean he retaliates against me?

755
01:08:36,581 --> 01:08:42,789
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) said: He will retaliate against you, because Islam made you equal.

756
01:08:45,269 --> 01:08:47,155
Jabillah(جبلَّه) said: Ya Ameer-Ul-Mo'mineen(يا اميرالمؤمنين)

757
01:08:48,108 --> 01:08:54,124
I thought that by becoming Muslim, Islam will only increase my honor.

758
01:08:55,559 --> 01:08:59,263
By becoming Muslim I will become even more honorable Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) said:

759
01:08:59,287 --> 01:09:00,402
دَعْ عَنْكَ هَذَا

760
01:09:01,072 --> 01:09:02,620
Keep this stuff away from me.

761
01:09:03,044 --> 01:09:06,665
You either settle him this with him peacefully or he retaliates against you.

762
01:09:07,489 --> 01:09:08,202
Jabillah(جبلَّه) said:

763
01:09:08,226 --> 01:09:09,128
اِذً أَاتَنَصَّرْ

764
01:09:09,152 --> 01:09:10,414
"Then I will become a Christian."

765
01:09:10,657 --> 01:09:12,545
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) said: Then I will behead you.

766
01:09:15,108 --> 01:09:17,299
You became Muslim, you cannot leave Islam.

767
01:09:19,755 --> 01:09:23,183
Jabillah(جبلَّه) came to realize that, he cannot talk Umar(عُمَر) out of it.

768
01:09:24,123 --> 01:09:24,877
So, he said;

769
01:09:25,095 --> 01:09:26,957
Give me some time to think it over.

770
01:09:28,017 --> 01:09:29,457
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) agreed.

771
01:09:30,237 --> 01:09:38,596
Jabillah(جبلَّه) under the cover of darkness withdrew out of Makkah and he ran away.

772
01:09:40,210 --> 01:09:43,273
And he went to Constantinople and settled there.

773
01:09:44,709 --> 01:09:48,761
Later on, he would regret his decision

774
01:09:49,607 --> 01:09:56,515
and he would write lines of poetry expressing his regret for what he has done.

775
01:09:57,353 --> 01:10:03,651
He has lost Islam, given up Islam because of personal pride.

776
01:10:07,020 --> 01:10:11,823
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) did not accommodate him because he is king or he is a new Muslim.

777
01:10:11,847 --> 01:10:17,093
Rules are rules, you have to abide by them, you are equal.

778
01:10:19,105 --> 01:10:22,563
I am the Khalifah(خليفه) and I am not giving myself any preferable status,

779
01:10:22,894 --> 01:10:25,914
who are you, to claim that special status for yourself.

780
01:10:34,078 --> 01:10:40,576
THE FREEDOMS THAT WERE TO GRANTED IN THE GOVERNMENT OF UMAR(عُمَر):

781
01:10:42,048 --> 01:10:45,716
He granted the religious freedom to the people of the Book.

782
01:10:48,046 --> 01:10:55,304
There were some restrictions that were placed for example, regarding the Hadith(حديث) of Rasool Allah ﷺ

783
01:10:55,562 --> 01:10:59,932
No two religions should exist in the Arabian peninsula.

784
01:11:00,373 --> 01:11:01,881
لَايَجْتَمِعْ فِيْهَا دِيْنَانْ

785
01:11:03,009 --> 01:11:11,280
Because of the, Arabian peninsula being the starting point of Islam

786
01:11:11,304 --> 01:11:15,062
and the homeland of Islam, where Makkah and Madina are.

787
01:11:16,558 --> 01:11:22,171
There is an exception to Arabia that no non Muslims are allowed to live there.

788
01:11:23,437 --> 01:11:30,305
And Arabia is Arabian peninsula which encompasses present day Saudi Arabia, Yemen, and Oman and the Gulf States.

789
01:11:31,833 --> 01:11:34,271
This rule does not apply to the rest of the Muslim world.

790
01:11:35,331 --> 01:11:41,219
Christians and Jews can live elsewhere but the Arabian Peninsula is only for Muslims.

791
01:11:43,516 --> 01:11:50,130
So, Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) forced the Jews of Khaybar(خيبر)

792
01:11:50,537 --> 01:11:54,409
and Christians of Najran(نجران) to leave Arabia.

793
01:11:55,592 --> 01:11:59,488
With the Jews of Khaybar(خيبر) they had an agreement between them and Rasool Allah ﷺ.

794
01:12:01,833 --> 01:12:06,477
Abdullah Ibn Umar(عبدالله بن عمر) had some business there, he had some farm land there, so he went

795
01:12:07,028 --> 01:12:11,147
at night he was attacked and his bones were crushed.

796
01:12:12,000 --> 01:12:14,169
They crushed the bones of his arms and feet.

797
01:12:16,451 --> 01:12:18,259
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) gave a Khuttba(خطبه) and he said:

798
01:12:18,339 --> 01:12:21,059
I suspect that nobody did this to my son but the Jews

799
01:12:21,183 --> 01:12:23,825
they are the only people who would do that in Khaybar(خيبر).

800
01:12:24,916 --> 01:12:30,154
Therefore, I am announcing that we will force them out of Khaybar(خيبر).

801
01:12:33,412 --> 01:12:37,125
One of their leaders came to Umar(عُمَر) and said;

802
01:12:37,327 --> 01:12:40,472
"O Umar(عُمَر) did you forget, that Rasool Allah ﷺ was the one,

803
01:12:40,758 --> 01:12:43,906
who allowed us to stay and he made an agreement with us.

804
01:12:44,836 --> 01:12:45,990
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) said;

805
01:12:46,264 --> 01:12:54,272
Did you forget that Rasool Allah ﷺ told you, that one day your camel will take you out day and night.

806
01:12:56,308 --> 01:13:00,246
So Rasool Allah ﷺ has already prophesized that, this man would leave

807
01:13:01,146 --> 01:13:07,284
but Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) compensated them, for all of their belongings in the Khaybar(خيبر)

808
01:13:08,209 --> 01:13:15,317
he paid them for their land and for their trees and they resettled in Ar-Riha(الرحا) in Falastine(فلسطين).

809
01:13:18,099 --> 01:13:23,251
With the Christians of Najran(نجران) Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) was becoming concerned

810
01:13:23,612 --> 01:13:26,994
that, it's becoming a plotting place against Muslims.

811
01:13:27,398 --> 01:13:32,486
So, the safety of Muslims comes first therefore he told them to leave,

812
01:13:32,901 --> 01:13:36,962
 and even though, he told them to leave, he told his governors in Iraq

813
01:13:37,271 --> 01:13:43,300
to allow them to settle in unsettle land and to take claim of that land to become their property.

814
01:13:43,960 --> 01:13:49,008
So, they settle in an area outside Al-Kofah(كوفة) and they claimed that land as their land.

815
01:13:49,623 --> 01:13:54,352
So, they were compensated and given property in a replacement for the property

816
01:13:54,376 --> 01:13:55,987
that was taken from them in Najran(نجران).

817
01:13:57,967 --> 01:14:03,775
Other than that Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) upheld the rulings regarding Ahl-Ad-Dhimmah(اهل الذمة),

818
01:14:04,272 --> 01:14:06,522
the Christians and Jews who are paying Jizya(جزيه)

819
01:14:09,911 --> 01:14:13,086
for example to show you his treatment now,

820
01:14:13,126 --> 01:14:17,507
by the way as an individual Jews and Christians did live in Madina

821
01:14:17,984 --> 01:14:23,742
and other places of Arabian peninsula but not as a significant presence.

822
01:14:24,643 --> 01:14:28,651
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) for example, he had a servant who was Christian and his name was Asheq(اشق).

823
01:14:31,742 --> 01:14:37,240
He told his servant, I want you to become a Muslim because I want to appoint you

824
01:14:39,101 --> 01:14:43,330
on some of our affairs and I am not gonna appoint, but a Muslim.

825
01:14:43,843 --> 01:14:45,964
Asheq(اشق) said; I am not going to leave my religion.

826
01:14:46,234 --> 01:14:47,134
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) said;

827
01:14:47,158 --> 01:14:47,993
لَا اِكْرَاهَ فِى الدِّيْنَ

828
01:14:48,473 --> 01:14:50,046
There is no compulsion in religion

829
01:14:52,375 --> 01:14:57,328
Asheq(اشق) said: When Umar(عُمَر) was passing away, he told me you are free go where ever you want.

830
01:14:58,474 --> 01:15:00,722
He freed him, he can go where ever he wants

831
01:15:04,986 --> 01:15:10,819
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) signed agreements with Christians of the Holy Land Jerusalem, Eliyah

832
01:15:11,304 --> 01:15:14,810
and he also signed agreements with the Christians of Egypt.

833
01:15:15,679 --> 01:15:23,577
For example, he promised to protect their Churches and their properties.

834
01:15:23,934 --> 01:15:24,398
 Umar(عُمَر) said;

835
01:15:24,422 --> 01:15:28,839
وَاِنَّا اَعْطَيْنَاهُمُ الْعَهْدْ عَلى اَنْ نُخَلِّيْ بَيْنَهُمْ وَ بَيْنَ كَنَائِسِهِمْ

836
01:15:30,319 --> 01:15:37,059
We have given them a covenant that, we would leave them to worship freely in their churches

837
01:15:37,285 --> 01:15:38,979
يَقُوْلُوْنَ فِيْهَا مَا بَدَا لَهُمْ

838
01:15:39,269 --> 01:15:42,963
And to say therein whatever they want, even though they are saying Kuffr(كفر).

839
01:15:44,634 --> 01:15:49,159
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) said, it is a covenant between us and them to say within their churches

840
01:15:49,401 --> 01:15:50,421
whatever they want.

841
01:15:52,864 --> 01:15:56,369
وَاَلَّا نُحَمِّلُهُمْ مَالَا يُطِيْقُوْنََ

842
01:15:56,785 --> 01:16:01,813
And we will not over burden them, meaning we will not have them pay more than what they are able to pay

843
01:16:03,627 --> 01:16:07,607
وَإِنْ أَرَادَهُمْ عَدُوَّهُمْ بِسُوْءٍ قَاتَلْنَا دُوْنَهُمْ

844
01:16:07,631 --> 01:16:12,968
And if an enemy wants to harm them, we would fight on their behalf to defend them.

845
01:16:16,354 --> 01:16:19,301
وَعَلى أَنْ نُخَلِّيَ بَيْنَهُمْ وَبَيْنَ أَحْكَامِهِمْ

846
01:16:19,837 --> 01:16:28,466
And we would allow them to appoint judges among themselves and to have their own separate legal system.

847
01:16:29,730 --> 01:16:32,928
إِلاَّ أَنْ يَأْتُوْرَاضِيْنَ بِأَحْكَامِنَا فَنَحْكُمْ بَيْنَهُمْ

848
01:16:33,171 --> 01:16:37,449
Except if they choose voluntarily to come to our courts.

849
01:16:38,865 --> 01:16:41,019
وَإِنْ غَيَّبُوْ اعَنَّا لَمْ نَتَعَرَّضْ لَهُمْ

850
01:16:41,043 --> 01:16:43,572
And if they stay away from us we will not harm them.

851
01:16:45,450 --> 01:16:46,786
Brothers and sisters!

852
01:16:47,591 --> 01:16:52,533
These legal accommodations that were given to non Muslims under the Islamic Khilafah(خِلَافَه)

853
01:16:52,574 --> 01:16:55,384
are not even given to us today in the 21st century.

854
01:16:57,903 --> 01:17:05,741
In the western democracies today, the minorities are forced to accept the rules of the majority, that’s democracy.

855
01:17:06,563 --> 01:17:07,866
Majority rules!

856
01:17:09,081 --> 01:17:12,331
However, in the Islamic Khilafah(خِلَافَه) the religious minorities

857
01:17:13,101 --> 01:17:15,871
have a right to have a separate legal system.

858
01:17:16,406 --> 01:17:22,364
They are free to choose, which courts they want to go whether it’s the Muslim or their own court system

859
01:17:22,900 --> 01:17:25,268
and the rules of the majority do not apply to them.

860
01:17:27,463 --> 01:17:31,159
When we are told that we have religious freedom, what religious freedom do we have?

861
01:17:31,401 --> 01:17:34,709
When we are forced to accept the legal system that is not Islamic.

862
01:17:37,015 --> 01:17:38,818
It's an issue of the numbers in the west.

863
01:17:39,826 --> 01:17:45,442
While in the Muslim world, whether the Christians were majority or minority in a community

864
01:17:45,666 --> 01:17:48,814
 they had their rights protected even if it's one person.

865
01:17:50,497 --> 01:17:55,965
So, when we talk about Muslims and having rights in the west today

866
01:17:56,556 --> 01:18:00,174
 I think that’s a broken record that doesn't play anymore.

867
01:18:00,662 --> 01:18:06,120
Now, Muslims are going to come to realize, when they start hitting the hard walls

868
01:18:06,918 --> 01:18:13,880
now, because in the old days, you know it was small families that came from back home,

869
01:18:14,360 --> 01:18:17,878
and whenever there's a dispute or an issue, they would solve it within the family.

870
01:18:18,255 --> 01:18:21,925
Now, we have grew to become large community.

871
01:18:22,179 --> 01:18:24,045
 Now, we are having problems

872
01:18:25,149 --> 01:18:33,853
and without having a Islamic legal system, we are living in a state of religious and social anarchy.

873
01:18:35,903 --> 01:18:42,004
There are tremendous family problems that are going around among the Muslims and we have no solution for them.

874
01:18:43,302 --> 01:18:47,190
For example, a wife is suffering because of an abusive husband

875
01:18:47,742 --> 01:18:52,730
and this wife is a righteous good sister, she is stuck between rock and hard place.

876
01:18:54,051 --> 01:18:58,759
She either goes to the Kuffar(كفار) legal system and she feels that she is doing something wrong

877
01:18:59,081 --> 01:19:01,599
or she just sits idly and accepts what happening,

878
01:19:01,968 --> 01:19:04,302
because there is no Islamic accommodation for her

879
01:19:04,653 --> 01:19:08,825
because we cannot have our laws, family laws implemented among ourselves.

880
01:19:09,959 --> 01:19:13,276
So, when we say that, we have our rights and our freedom what rights do we have?

881
01:19:14,295 --> 01:19:19,413
You are talking about your right to pray, they had that in Makkah, in the early days of Daw'ah(دعوة)

882
01:19:19,437 --> 01:19:23,407
they were able to pray in Makkah but that’s not Islam, that’s not what Islam is all about

883
01:19:23,706 --> 01:19:25,174
Islam is about the way of life.

884
01:19:28,392 --> 01:19:32,270
When a wife runs away with the kids, what did the husband do?

885
01:19:33,314 --> 01:19:38,020
Sometimes it happens a wife would runaway with the kids, she would go and date a Kafir(كافر)

886
01:19:38,231 --> 01:19:41,309
and the kids end up growing up as non Muslims, what can the father do?

887
01:19:42,583 --> 01:19:47,871
As parents you want to discipline your children and bring them up to grow up as being good Muslims.

888
01:19:48,097 --> 01:19:51,825
They threaten to call police on you and you can’t do anything.

889
01:19:52,944 --> 01:19:57,388
In the western democracies the state have more authority over your direct family,

